  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/6297029b-d1dc-45eb-9bfd-5b47af85effc.png\" style=\"height: 156px; width: 200px;\" /><br />Slope of <math><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi></math> is <math><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Now, the slope of <math><mi>E</mi><mi>S</mi></math> is <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mn>1</mn></math><br />Equation of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Equation of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math><br />Hence, the equation of circumcircle is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>",
